<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P affirms debt ratings for Fuji Bank.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms debt ratings for Fuji Bank.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday that it had affirmed its A- long-term debt rating and A-2 short-term debt rating on Fuji Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it was still concerned about the bank's existing problem loans and about newly emerging bad credits, but also said Fuji Bank was benefitting from its strong domestic franchise.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
